  "note": "`Accent.dine` gives rootTest(B − O(c)) ≤ `stockK`·(stakes/w), where `stockK` = 2e^{columnLogs h}|c|₁ and w satisfies w‖alto‖·4(1+C_{J_h})/`gainChart` h m ≤ ζ/2. The proof of `Accent.inTime` sets w = (ζ/2)·`gainChart`/(4(1+C_{J_h})‖alto‖), so the bound becomes C·e^{Σ log C_{J_{i+1}}}(1+C_{J_h})e^{−(s_h−s_m)/8}, as in [M].",
